# Repo-wide LF normalisation, fixing the pre-existing CRLF-vs-LF mismatch
# recorded in .planning/phases/02-vehicle-feel-core/deferred-items.md: this
# Windows worktree's `core.autocrlf=true` checks every file out with CRLF line
# endings on disk, while biome's formatter (and the committed git blobs
# themselves) expect LF. This is the smaller, non-Windows-specific fix path —
# matching the repo to its own already-LF committed content — chosen over the
# alternative of setting `formatter.lineEnding: "crlf"` in biome.json.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets later plans commit (e.g. plan 03-10's CC0 audio files, future
# glTF models) must never be line-ending-mangled by the `text=auto` rule above.
*.glb binary
*.wasm binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
*.mp3 binary
